== Dormancy: recall latency, cold from the SSD (O_DIRECT), including 30 skipped nights applied on recall, then one forward pass ==
  awake neuron in RAM: fire only                             p50      10 us  p99      19 us   [read      0 + unzip     0 + catch-up&fire     10]
  neuron in RAM: catch up 30 nights + fire                   p50      35 us  p99      45 us   [read      0 + unzip     0 + catch-up&fire     35]
  1 dormant neuron, raw, anywhere in the 24 GiB brain        p50     228 us  p99   1,537 us   [read    155 + unzip     0 + catch-up&fire     68]
  1 dormant neuron, raw, within a 0.35 GB span               p50     145 us  p99     271 us   [read     74 + unzip     0 + catch-up&fire     69]
  1 dormant neuron, own zstd+dict frame (0.35 GB archive)    p50     172 us  p99   1,234 us   [read     91 + unzip     8 + catch-up&fire     69]
  1 dormant neuron, via its column's zstd frame              p50   2,441 us  p99   4,246 us   [read    340 + unzip 1,999 + catch-up&fire    109]
  1 dormant column (1,024 neurons), raw (1 MiB read)         p50   4,326 us  p99   5,795 us   [read    603 + unzip     0 + catch-up&fire  3,706]
  1 dormant column, zstd frame (~0.3 MiB read)               p50   6,176 us  p99   8,685 us   [read    399 + unzip 1,614 + catch-up&fire  3,779]
== Dormancy: batch recall of 256 random columns (256 MiB raw) ==
  raw:  read 78 ms + catch-up&fire = 785 ms (0.34 GB/s of neurons recalled, 0.33 M neurons/s)
  zstd: read 41 ms + decompress 355 ms + catch-up&fire 735 ms = 1131 ms (0.24 GB/s recalled)
